s.google.com/document/d/1PLu_eTg03h4ogiTSGSkzEB7T_1YpB9_VkhHmgZN41-I/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Star Wars d10</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">T</a><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">he Fallen for Demon: the Descent</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-TDr4NF_5cUn-In2vjI9P5LTKqsu9B4-OMxbnbaTgT8/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Requiem for a Masquerade: VtR 2e Cainite Conversion</a> (<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HpKi5giBNsQrZRLIRRjaCe7sHVm1Q13ravVYlE45Dbw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Vampira Roma</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1601-dreaminggod","name":"Dreaminggod","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"745"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T10:27:53-08:00","id":1050572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>deejay</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1050458#post1050458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What offended you? If you can say without spoilers?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thete's a massively sexualized trans character who no shit says &quot;So I'm trans and I have like a cock&quot; as part of a story about how she gives strangers blowjobs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T10:28:18-08:00","id":1050573,"title":"","content":"I liked the vampire one. The story was really creepy and I liked how out the gate they left a lot more mystery to the story. It was kind of nice to see the setting from the point of view of someone who didn't know all of the words with the capital letters. <br /> <br /> I can kind of see what loomer is talking about in regards to the writing... the way the characters talk can be a little difficult to parse at times. I don't think it is bad writing, in fact I think it kind of adds to the air of mystery and tension in that you don't always have a clear picture of what is going on. The fact that the art is more abstract than concrete keeps you in your head space for most of the story... which makes it less like a video game and more like a short story. That said I think I probably missed a few salient points in the story and will probably give it a replay.<br /> <br /> Choice wise, there was one point in the story where some previous actions had whittled down my options, and I was left with only one choice, which is fine. I did end up in a kind of weird place where I died, and generally restarting takes you to before the last meaningful choice you made. And the last meaningful choice was no choice, so I had to restart the chapter. Kind of a pain, but it didn't take long to get back to where I was and continue the story. As for whether my choices mattered... *shrug* It's kind of hard to say, I only restarted when I died, which was a lot. I don't think I would make a good vampire. =]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T10:39:29-08:00","id":1050575,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1050572#post1050572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thete's a massively sexualized trans character who no shit says &quot;So I'm trans and I have like a cock&quot; as part of a story about how she gives strangers blowjobs.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Put more in context, she is describing her feeding strategy to the POV character, and she says it in order to find out whether the potential meal is prejudiced or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T10:41:38-08:00","id":1050580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggy711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1050575#post1050575\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Put more in context, she is describing her feeding strategy to the POV character, and she says it in order to find out whether the potential meal is prejudiced or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>No trans person has ever spoken like that. Ever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T11:18:28-08:00","id":1050605,"title":"","content":"That feel when everyone in the story is a depraved inhuman lunatic but since that includes trans characters acting inhuman and depraved it suddenly becomes problematic","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T11:37:24-08:00","id":1050618,"title":"","content":"Even then, for me, it only comes up in one part of the game and never really comes up again. If the character constantly brought it up I'd see it more as an issue, but they really don't.<br /> <br /> Considering how much the gaming news is quick to bring up any issue with portrayal of LGBT characters in games (especially with the current socio-political climate) curiously, none of them have yet to report on it. Huh.<br /> <br /> The Vampire story itself was fine. The descent of the main character from a lost and desperate human to embracing (lol) their inhumanity as a Kindred. Neat thing being that, with being titled &quot;Prelude&quot; it really doesn't get too crazy about VtM lore and terms. So it doesn't alienate any newcomers to the VtM setting. And for the most part, sticks with the established vampire tropes that everyone knows. Anything that Case reasonably wouldn't know, they ask. I find it a bit head-tilting as well on making the Tremere seem like a crazy cult which seems OOC for them. Seems more like a Lasombra thing, but whatever.<br /> <br /> Still need to play the Mage story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T11:56:43-08:00","id":1050630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theony