code b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/5yEiIi5.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/5yEiIi5.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/5yEiIi5.png\" target=\"_blank\"> http://i.imgur.com/5yEiIi5.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Quality writing, everyone. Quality writing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here's a fun tidbit for y'all to chew on: Zak Smith, the author of this, has a longstanding beef with a lot of folks in the storygame indie RPG scene... folks like Avery Alder, a trans woman and author of Monsterhearts. <br /> <br /> So I'll leave that to you what it means when he puts an oversexualized caricature of a trans character in his game and just happens to name her Avery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T12:13:34-08:00","id":1051084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1051068#post1051068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Here's a fun tidbit for y'all to chew on: Zak Smith, the author of this, has a longstanding beef with a lot of folks in the storygame indie RPG scene... folks like Avery Alder, a trans woman and author of Monsterhearts.<br /> <br /> So I'll leave that to you what it means when he puts an oversexualized caricature of a trans character in his game and just happens to name her Avery.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's funny, because the fact that you're overtly talking about the things he's done means this thread'll likely be deleted like the last one was.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://imgflip.com/s/meme/But-Thats-None-Of-My-Business.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T12:15:31-08:00","id":1051085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1051084#post1051084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's funny, because the fact that you're overtly talking about the things he's done means this thread'll likely be deleted like the last one was.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://imgflip.com/s/meme/But-Thats-None-Of-My-Business.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>That thread's actually back up, but who knows for how long.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T12:19:11-08:00","id":1051089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1051085#post1051085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That thread's actually back up, but who knows for how long.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe they're following our FB posting, who knows? Some of us are making public posts. Not me, but some of us.<br /> <br /> Anywho. <br /> <br /> Just a lot of bullshit going on. That's what I've got to say right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T12:20:40-08:00","id":1051093,"title":"","content":"Also, I definitely don't see the older thread, just went looking for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T13:13:39-08:00","id":1051122,"title":"","content":"I have to say I quite like the Mage prelude on the other hand.<br /> The writing (as in, the sentences themselves) are kept simple at times, but it fits a roll-your-adventure book.<br /> The Mage Prelude has is simplified and seems aimed at people new to the game, but with the music and the art, it actually manages to build up quite an atmosphere, especially in the later chapters.<br /> <br /> I like it. Even if I feel like it should give you MORE choices.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T14:29:21-08:00","id":1051145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>InfernalGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1051041#post1051041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, to be fair this Zak guy hangs out and RPs with porn stars. It wouldn't surprise me if they talked very openly about sex. Write what you know and all that.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Write what you know&quot; is not an excuse for this. The objection is also not, as you're trying to recast it, to talking and writing about sex in an interesting, mature way. That's fine, in itself, and creates plenty of interesting material and scenarios if you use it right, so that's not the problem here. The problem here is that a, <i>what the hell is going on with the one trans character in the story here</i>, <i>did they seriously just publish an actual transmisogynist stereotype (potentially/probably one named after a trans game developer Zak has a bad history with, what the fuck?!)</i>, and b, <i>the writing is fucking dreadful</i>. A is rather more serious than B, obviously, but I feel like it needs to be said as well.<br /> <br /> <i>That</i> is not good writing, and neither are the scenes where the PC is typing what they're doing in the middle of complicated actions. Some might be willing to overlook problematic elements for great work - someone expressed that stance in one of the other threads, in fact - but this isn't great work. This is dogshit, and it also isn't writing about sex in an interesting, mature way - or even a gross, immature, but fun way since let's face it that can be pretty fun too. So not only is it some seriously fucked up transmisogynystic stereotyping, but if its goal was to be good writing about sex for a mature audience, it failed, and so far that's been a recurring theme. 2 out of 3 nWhite Wolf publications have gone to that well so far, with the same level of ineptitude, so it may be time to start taking slightly more notice of a trend than just shrugging it off because of this particular author's background.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T15:04:41-08:00","id":1051165,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>loomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1051145#post1051145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>what the hell is going on with the <b>one trans character </b>in the story here</i>, <i>did they seriously just publish an actual transmisogynist stereotype (potentially/probably one named after a trans game developer Zak has a bad history with, what the fuck?!)</i>, and b, <i>the writing is fucking dreadful</i>. A is rather more serious than B, obviously, but I feel like it needs to be said as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bWhat about the other trans character in the story? Morgan is not a porn queen who talks about her genetalia, or is oversexualized in any way. Also, at what point am I recasting the objection of the thread? I'm offering up an alternative reason for why this character was portrayed the way she was in the story.<br /> <br /> If you're going to accuse me of recasting the objection, then at least portray your objection in an accurate manner. From your comment, I can only draw the conclusion that either you didn't play the game and are only objecting to the screen grabs that have been presented, or you have played the game and you are leaving facts out, and thus arguing in bad faith.<br /> <br /> \u200bSee, we can both be juvenile.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">Malkavian Madness Forum</a> - Your pbp fix. Be it nWoD, cWoD, CoC, D&amp;D or something else entirely, come over here and get your game on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/348-infernalgoose","name":"InfernalGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T15:09:30-08:00","id":1051171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>InfernalGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1051165#post1051165\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bWhat about the other trans character in the story? Morgan is not a porn queen who talks about her genetalia, or is oversexualized in any way. Also, at what point am I recasting the objection of the thread? I'm offering up an alternative reason for why this character was portrayed the way she was in the story.<br /> <br /> If you're going to accuse me of recasting the objection, then at least portray your objection in an accurate manner. From your comment, I can only draw the conclusion that either you didn't play the game and are only objecting to the screen grabs that have been presented, or you have played the game and you are leaving facts out, and thus arguing in bad faith.<br /> <br /> \u200bSee, we can both be juvenile.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, is Morgan trans? I didn't know that, so consider me corrected on that point. And you're quite right - I haven't played. In fact, I'm actually boycotting any and all white wolf products until such a time as Mr. Smith is removed from nWW's roster.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-18T15:21:43-08:00","id":1051175,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>loomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1051171#post1051171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In fact, I'm actually boycotting any and all white wolf products until such a time as Mr. Smith is removed from nWW's roster.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bAnd that is a valid stance to take. Vote with your wallet, sir.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">Malkavian Madness Forum</a> - Your pbp fix. Be it nWoD, cWoD, CoC, D&amp;D or something else entirely, come over here and get your game on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/348-infernalgoose","name":"InfernalGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-19T00:29:47-08:00","id":1051403,"title":"","content":"EDIT: Nvm. I'm dumb. Didn't play all the way through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 02-19-2017, 03:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-19T03:22:15-08:00","id":1051446,"title":"","content":"I liked the game (vampire) and absolutely love they mentioned some character from Bloodline. Some controversial topics did not bother me, but I am not from USA and political crap is something usual in my country and for World of Darkness.<br /> Did not like interface so, no option, no menu, no skip button for seen messages killed replay for me (((","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sorry for any mistakes. English is not my native language.","edited":{"userid":12638,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12638-rogneda","user":"Rogneda","date":". 02-19-2017, 09:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12638-rogneda","name":"Rogneda","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-19T11:50:01-08:00","id":1051597,"title":"","content":"Just finished the Mage game. It was...okay. Found the most enjoyment with the technocracy ending, because that's just who I am(a bastard) and proud of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-20T00:39:31-08:00","id":1051889,"title":"","content":"Bought it on Steam. <br /> <br /> Vampire started out quite intriguing and the writing had a certain charm to it. The wtf is going on interplay between Izzy and Case was generally quite amusing. As it went on though, the tone just became cartoonish and edgy for the sake of it. The worst offenders being Avery's writing and the tirade that Marco goes off on.<br /> <br /> Literally couldn't be bothered, so refunded.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The phrase 'flies on the heads of pins' appeared 43 times in that journal, sometimes in the middle of sentences or written in the margins.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4871-malkydel","name":"Malkydel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4871_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-20T10:53:57-08:00","id":1052058,"title":"","content":"I've not played the game, but having the Tremere be hard line Noddists seems like a weird choice to me. From my perspective the Tremere should be the clan least into Noddism. While they're big into occult texts and Noddism doesn't lack for those I've always felt the real meat and potatoes of Noddism lies in oral tradition passed from sire to childer. Since the Tremere don't go back to First City and sire/childer relationships are generally not as emphasized in the pyramid I don't think there would be as much of a connection there. There's also the fact that the more you talk about ancient Noddist lore the more you draw attention to the fact that the Tremere are late-coming usurpers, which doesn't seem like something they'd be keen on. Finally there's the fact that entering vampirism from the outside, specifically as an order of mages, and the methological practice of their blood magic, means that their perspective on the vampiric condition should arguably be broader and open to a larger set of definitions than generally provided in Noddist orthodoxy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-20T11:48:13-08:00","id":1052077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1052058#post1052058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've not played the game, but having the Tremere be hard line Noddists seems like a weird choice to me. From my perspective the Tremere should be the clan least into Noddism. While they're big into occult texts and Noddism doesn't lack for those I've always felt the real meat and potatoes of Noddism lies in oral tradition passed from sire to childer. Since the Tremere don't go back to First City and sire/childer relationships are generally not as emphasized in the pyramid I don't think there would be as much of a connection there. There's also the fact that the more you talk about ancient Noddist lore the more you draw attention to the fact that the Tremere are late-coming usurpers, which doesn't seem like something they'd be keen on. Finally there's the fact that entering vampirism from the outside, specifically as an order of mages, and the methological practice of their blood magic, means that their perspective on the vampiric condition should arguably be broader and open to a larger set of definitions than generally provided in Noddist orthodoxy.</div> </div> </div> </div>My own theory on this is that the Tzimisce infection of clan Tremere has reached its critical state. They're now more like their parent clan : a collection of Noddists, post-humans and flesh crafters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">Malkavian Madness Forum</a> - Your pbp fix. Be it nWoD, cWoD, CoC, D&amp;D or something else entirely, come over here and get your game on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/348-infernalgoose","name":"InfernalGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-21T08:07:26-08:00","id":1052578,"title":"","content":"What in the name of all that may or may not be holy.....<br /> <br /> A trans porn star? With dialogue no transwoman would ever use? In a White Wolf product? Dear sweet gods...<br /> <br /> For the past several years, White Wolf -- or at the very least, Onyx Path -- has been making a careful and conscious choice to be respectful in their writing on this and other matters. And then some subcontracted clown comes along and pulls a stunt like THIS?!?<br /> <br /> Onyx Path will continue to get my love, because while I'm aware that some small part of their profits have to go to White Wolf licensing, that's not something they can really avoid, and the crew at Onyx Path has been exemplary on such matters. But White Wolf needs to cut the writer and product loose, and they need to do it yesterday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1731-jessilaurn","name":"Jessilaurn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1731_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-21T09:43:17-08:00","id":1052608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>InfernalGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1052077#post1052077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My own theory on this is that the Tzimisce infection of clan Tremere has reached its critical state. They're now more like their parent clan : a collection of Noddists, post-humans and flesh crafters.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope not. I loved this smartass clan so much...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sorry for any mistakes. English is not my native language.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12638-rogneda","name":"Rogneda","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-21T13:40:57-08:00","id":1052736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jessilaurn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1052578#post1052578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What in the name of all that may or may not be holy.....<br /> <br /> A trans porn star? With dialogue no transwoman would ever use? In a White Wolf product? Dear sweet gods...</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't have a problem with the trans porn star. They exist in the real world, so they should exist in the World of Darkness. <br /> <br /> I didn't have a problem with the language, either. Since, perhaps, a trans porn star would possibly use that sort of language. <br /> <br /> What I have a problem with is the author carrying a personal beef with a trans author and placing it into his own personal work(using her name, etc.) which is all sorts of fucked up. You just don't do that.<br /> <br /> The other trans character in the story(Morgan) I thought was well-written and was arguably my favorite character(along with Alfonso). Unfortunately, the dialogue got worse as the story went on and what once showed promise, merely ended up mediocre.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-21T15:36:10-08:00","id":1052841,"title":"","content":"There are legitimate issues with Zak Smith, but all this talk of objecification and sexualization is bullshit nonsense, it's just one man's fantasy/vision, and not a political statement on the trans community. <br /> <br /> At least be honest about the real issues against Zak, instead of hiding it behind acting like having a horny trans character in a story is an attack on the trans community, it's not. <br /> <br /> Is it realistic that even a trans character would offer random uber drives hand jobs for not being trabsphobic or Trump voters? (I'll point out there are trans voters and others in the GLBT community who voted Trump, but that not really important here), no doubt it, if for no other reason that would be extremely dangerous given that there are still people out there that would react violently to such an offer. <br /> <br /> But you know what else is unrealistic, and actually imposdible instead of merely being improbable? Fucking Vampires and a secret society of vampires!<br /> <br /> This is make believe, not a guide to the trans community.<br /> <br /> Sexualization, Objectification, and the Male Gaze are all ridiculous ideas used to demonize men, male sexuality by people who wish to control and manipulate men and women.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 02-21-2017, 06:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-21T16:03:47-08:00","id":1052872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1052841#post1052841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are legitimate issues with Zak Smith, but all this talk of objecification and sexualization is bullshit nonsense, it's just one man's fantasy/vision, and not a political statement on the trans community.<br /> <br /> At least be honest about the real issues against Zak, instead of hiding it behind acting like having a horny trans character in a story is an attack on the trans community, it's not.<br /> <br /> Is it realistic that even a trans character would offer random uber drives hand jobs for not being trabsphobic or Trump voters? (I'll point out there are trans voters and others in the GLBT community who voted Trump, but that not really important here), no doubt it, if for no other reason that would be extremely dangerous given that there are still people out there that would react violently to such an offer.<br /> <br /> But you know what else is unrealistic, and actually imposdible instead of merely being improbable? Fucking Vampires and a secret society of vampires!<br /> <br /> This is make believe, not a guide to the trans community.<br /> <br /> Sexualization, Objectification, and the Male Gaze are all ridiculous ideas used to demonize men, male sexuality by people who wish to control and manipulate men and women.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm actually not surprised. For some people, everything is part of a narrative and everything is ultimately about the 'war'.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If nothing worked, then let's think!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6363-pm\u00e1rk","name":"PM\u00e1rk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2363"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-21T18:32:06-08:00","id":1052959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1052841#post1052841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are legitimate issues with Zak Smith, but all this talk of objecification and sexualization is bullshit nonsense, it's just one man's fantasy/vision, and not a political statement on the trans community.</div> </div> </div> </div>I find this kind of amusing considering that Zak has very strong views about objectification that would probably make you ideological opponents in any discussion of it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> At least be honest about the real issues against Zak, instead of hiding it behind acting like having a horny trans character in a story is an attack on the trans community, it's not. </div> </div> </div>It's not a &quot;horny trans character&quot; it's a &quot;serial killer trans character that kills anyone that doesn't meet her ideological purity test.&quot;<br /> <br /> There's a pretty big difference there. If you're not progressive enough in her eyes, she kills you. That might not be an attack on the LGBTQ community, but it is piss poor representation of LGTBQ individuals in fiction.<br /> <br /> In an effort to try to put this into context you'll identify with. If the story included a Ventrue MRA that uses Dominate to find definite victims of rape, rape them himself, and then used Dominate to force them to tell the police that they faked their report of the real rape that happened against them. How would this make you feel?<br /> <br /> How would you feel if people went, &quot;MRAs don't care about this MRA character, they care about Zak's anti-MRA politics.&quot; And yes, Zak is very anti-MRA.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> But you know what else is unrealistic, and actually imposdible instead of merely being improbable? </div> </div> </div>Nope. This is not acceptable.<br /> <br /> &quot;Dracula isn't a book with really problematic racism in it, because it's fiction and vampires aren't real!&quot; is not how things work.<br /> <br /> Bigotry being promoted by fiction is bigotry by the authors, not make believe just because the story is fiction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-21T21:01:08-08:00","id":1053023,"title":"","content":"Couldn't agree more with Heavy Arms here, and that's without even going into the subtext and implications of this whole Avery mess. <br /> <br /> Because just at face value alone you have a: Kindred prostitute who only feeds from men, who heavy handedly uses her gender to elicit a response from her prey, who then either sucks their dick exactly how they like it no matter their preferences or style if she agrees with their response to her gender, or straight up kills them if she doesn't agree with their response to her gender. <br /> <br /> And if it was just that we could all chalk it up to bad writing or a poor aesthetic decision. But it's not just that. The author named the character Avery. The author is known to have a grudge against a game designer named Avery Alder. Which means, that the design decisions for the character Avery takes on whole new dimensions filled with potentialy petty hate filled subtext. <br /> <br /> And petty kinda sums it all up for me, since if this was just his own project then we could all just chalk it up to the author making a petty jab at a rival and just leave it at that. But this is World of Darkness, specifically the Prelude to Vampire the F$&amp;king Masquerade 5th Edition. Which means that unless specifically stated by White Wolf, that story and all of it's characters are now part of the Canon Lore for the setting. Which means that one author's petty grudge is now forever a part of the Vampire the Masquerade setting. <br /> <br /> Just...the implications alone...god this is depressing...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Spellcheck 02-22-2017, 12:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-22T00:41:32-08:00","id":1053089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1053023#post1053023\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...exactly how they like it no matter their preferences or style...</div> </div> </div> </div>Just want to highlight something here.<br /> <br /> There's really only two options here with how the character expresses her actions:<br /> <br /> 1) She's lying/exaggerating (and this is the better option...) about her success rates because there is no way she gets a &quot;yes&quot; from every man she meets on charm alone. There are lots of men who would pass her purity test and would not want to have her suck them off for any of a multitude of reasons; she is not describing johns coming to her as a prostitute during this, but actively using Uber to deliver her victims in the form of Uber drivers.<br /> <br /> 2) She's using Disciplines to magically remove consent from some of the men <b>she approves of</b> and is sexually assaulting them. <br /> <br /> Neither of these do anything but make the character more problematic. She's a liar (remember Zak S abhors liars), or she's a serial sexual assaulter/murderer, or a mixture of these things.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-22T02:50:54-08:00","id":1053112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>loomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1050293-world-of-darkness-preludes?p=1050872#post1050872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This would be the offensive bit. One of them - the part about the severed ass is pretty eye-rolly too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/5yEiIi5.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/5yEiIi5.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"